    { book: "rt100", title: "RIP & TAP · +100%", note: "Love's idea (Oct 8): gold and silver break through one session line and tap the next in the same window; the side paying 4x+ is taken at $10. Sells at +100%, otherwise the bell. Twins: +200% and 90% of the max. Paper." },
