    { book: "dcd", title: "DECIDED", note: "Love's idea (Oct 8): buy the side that has already made its decision. BTC already $125 past the strike, gold $3, still paying 1.28x or more, no band in front (BTC: none of her lines within $30 ahead; gold: no nav band within $0.50). One per window per asset, 2+ minutes left, same exits as the others. Less profit, fewer losers? Paper." },
    { book: "gclear", title: "GOLD · CLEAR $1.50", note: "Love's test (Oct 8): her live books' gold trades (one per window, the first RUN book to fire), skipping any with a session or nav line within $1.50 of the strike. Compare with GOLD · ALL (the same trades, none skipped) over the week. Paper." },
