    { book: "reent", title: "BTC RE-ENTRY", note: "Love's idea (Oct 8): when last window's live-book trade left early on LOCK THE WIN or a GATE, she takes the same side again in the first 2 minutes of the next BTC window, normal exits. Lab: BTC 57% next-window follow-through (+$275 on 153 at $30 after fees); gold 48% (-$419), so BTC only. Paper." },
    { book: "bank5px", title: "BANK SOLE+ · 5M CLOSE EXIT", note: "BANK · 5M SOLE+ exactly plus Love's exit: the first 5-minute close on the far side of the line she entered on = out, win or lose. The backtest liked it in every version (+$2 to +$85 on $50 stakes)." },
    { book: "claudex", title: "CLAUDE · 5M CLOSE EXIT", note: "CLAUDE exactly plus Love's exit: the first 5-minute close on the far side of the line she entered on = out, win or lose. The backtest liked this one (+$78 to +$120 on $50 stakes)." },
