    { book: "bank5p", title: "BANK · 5M SOLE+ ⛨", note: "5M SOLE+'s exact entries with BANK's exits: after +30% she sells 5% off the highest bid; a band tap the 1m candle rejects banks it (in profit only). Built to get out before the L. Paper, started Oct 5 ~1 AM." },
    { book: "sole5p", title: "5M · SOLE+", note: "5M SOLE's rules exactly, judging the desk's setups AND BRICK's own signals. If SOLE's rules work as a filter, this keeps BRICK's good calls and drops the wrong-side ones. 1.38x+, no gates or locks." },
    { book: "sole5z", title: "5M · SOLE ZONE", note: "5M SOLE plus Love's lined-up rule: where a session band and a 5m nav line sit together (within 0.08σ, about $4 on BTC), she won't trade into that zone or from inside it until price breaks through all of it." },
