    { book: "sole15", title: "15M · SOLE", note: "The same, judged ONLY by the session bands + the 15m nav." },
    { book: "lastmin", title: "LAST MINUTE ⏳", note: "The last 5 minutes of a window: price on the right side of the strike and that side still pays 1.32x-1.5x. Only when her lines agree: right side of the session VWAP, not in the 25% of the channel by the line in front (session + 5m nav), and far enough past the strike for the time left. Secures the take profit, else the bell." },
    { book: "lastgrant", title: "LAST MINUTE · YOU + GRANT", note: "Your and Grant's rule: 3 minutes or less left, BTC $110+ past the strike, gold $3+ past it with none of her lines between the strike and price (or within $1.50). 1.32x+. Same take profit, else the bell." },
    { book: "confirm", title: "CONFIRM ⇄ · BTC", note: "Love's hunch: a band break on Pepperstone or Vantage, entered only when the OTHER feed breaks the same line the same way within 60 seconds. Her 25% channel rule, 1.38x+." },
